### Login (fresh)
POST http://localhost:5017/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mitsubishi.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Get all dealers (kosong dulu)
GET http://localhost:5017/api/dealers

### Create dealer - Jakarta Selatan
POST http://localhost:5017/api/dealers
